OL,3,GNEWSA'In the morning we can go home -
OL,4,Amany people can't'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayor who has slept on the street for
OL,7,Fcharity has said she felt it was "the
OL,8,Fleast" she could do because homeless
OL,9,Fpeople had no choice but to "do this
OL,10,Fall the time".
OL,12,FMayor of Redcar and Cleveland Ceri
OL,13,FCawley slept outside the Boosbeck
OL,14,FVillage Hall in Saltburn with former
OL,15,Fmayor Barry Hunt and deputy mayor Adam
OL,16,FBrook, along with four formerly
OL,17,Fhomeless veterans, who shared their
OL,18,Fexperiences of rough sleeping.
OL,20,FCawley said: "Hearing the stories
OL,21,Ffirst-hand brings it to reality.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
